- Open the related activity
- Manage notification preferences

Notifications must persist across page reloads and devices.

### B. Real-time website notifications

When the recipient is online, deliver new notifications in real time.

Use an appropriate real-time backend technology such as:
- WebSockets
- Socket.IO
- Server-Sent Events
- An existing supported real-time service

Inspect the current backend before selecting the implementation.

When a buyer sends a message, the seller should see:
- A notification badge update
- A new message in the conversation
- A toast or notification popup where appropriate

The recipient should not need to refresh the page.

### C. Browser push notifications

Implement browser push notifications for supported browsers.

Support:
- Notification permission request
- Service worker
- Push subscription
- Secure subscription storage
- Notification delivery
- Notification click handling
